WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:04.100
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.740
<i>I got time off to come back here,</i>

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.890
<i>but I can't keep doing this forever...</i>

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.290
Jeez, how'd you end up like this?

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.430
At the end of the day, 
you really are a tanuki...

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.020
Huh?! What the?!

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.670
Souta-kun!

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.930
Come out an' play!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:01.700
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.000
<b>Episode 3: "The Red Lighthouse"</b>

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.240
Let's go fishin'. Fishin'!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.410
Uh... It's 3:00 AM.

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:29.110
We'll go out on a boat

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.480
and catch us some big ones.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.450
What about the hospital?

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.670
You said you were busy. 
Did you get a day off?

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:36.080
It's fine!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.660
Ain't no one at death's door today,

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.400
and I shouldn't get called in, either!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.880
"Death's door"?

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.680
Souta?

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:45.480
Poco!

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:46.430
Po...?

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.980
What's with the runt?

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.080
Oh... Er...

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.890
Remember the kid I told 
you about on the phone?

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.420
As it turns out, I guess this is the 
child of a friend of mine in Tokyo.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:17.040
Anyway, it's a long story...

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.370
But we decided that I'd take 
care of the kid for a while.

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.110
Sounds like a headache, 
so I won't ask for the details.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.350
I don't wanna hear 'em, either.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:28.470
But I do happen to know a darn good lawyer.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.360
If ya ever need help...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.000
Don't talk like I'm breaking the law!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.730
He can turn black to white!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.470
Yikes, look at all the handprints...

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.710
Don't touch the car!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:45.160
Touch, touch!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.040
Look, Poco.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.690
This is Nakajima Shinobu.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.420
We've been friends since we were kids.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.060
He doesn't look it, but he's a doctor.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.810
Po... co?

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.310
Nakaji.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.560
I know kids can't choose their parents,

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.320
but not only did they 
stick ya with that name,

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.770
they left ya with some strange old guy, too...

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.810
Poor little thing...

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.520
Did ya think that was what I'd say?!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.200
Stupid! Stupid!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.520
<b>Whoosh
Whoosh</b>

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.530
I wanna go have fun with you, stupid!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:23.670
You always show up unannounced, 
and you have no common sense!

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.720
What's your problem?

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.550
Here I came by to hang out 
with ya while you're in town!

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.360
I can't go boat fishing!

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:32.200
Not when I have Poco. 
Who knows what could happen?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.130
Nakaji.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:37.760
Wh...

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.130
What?!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:43.630
<b>Whoosh
Whoosh</b>

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.920
What's with that look of pity?! 
You makin' fun of me?!

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.630
Please just go home!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:51.350
I told you I wasn't going, didn't I?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.870
This ain't boat fishin'.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.320
Yeah, but still...

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.190
You can at least fish from here 
for black porgy or rockfish, right?

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.710
What I really wanted was to take a boat out,

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.550
and I don't want a kid here, either.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:04.800
How many compromises 
do you think I made for you?

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.530
Huh? Why are you making 
me out to be the bad guy?

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.530
Touch, touch...

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:12.290
Don't touch the car. 
Now let's get a move on.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.100
Souta!

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:20.590
There, there.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:22.670
Souta.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:31.770
What the heck...

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:38.690
Poco, this is called a "lighthouse."

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.490
Lighthouse?

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:44.640
A lighthouse is a guide for boats out at sea

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.940
to follow when they want to go home.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.570
Go home?

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:49.800
That's right.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.320
Touch, touch!

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.830
I don't think you can reach it...

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.340
I touch!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.710
Oh, all right.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.570
Ow...

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.920
Ya still got that?

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.040
Huh?

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.850
Ah, yeah.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.610
It hurts now and then.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.480
Stitches are our job in orthopedics.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.180
Next time you hurt yourself, 
let me sew ya back up.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:28.930
I'd do a better job than that.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:30.780
I'll be counting on you.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.430
Just say "Countin' on ya"!

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:33.020
Huh?

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:35.540
Seriously, you sound so wrong
without your accent.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.740
Hey, Souta.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:48.860
I've been wantin' to ask you something.

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:50.830
The kid...

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.510
What is it?

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.680
Wh-What... is it?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.940
<i>B-Back there, did he...</i>

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.250
<i>Did he see?!</i>

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.530
So? What is it?

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.740
Er...

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.480
Actually, uh...

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.760
A girl, right?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.040
Huh?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.550
I said, "Poco's a girl, right?"

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.300
Oh, you meant that?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.420
"That"?

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.150
What else would I mean?

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.280
Nothing, nothing.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:28.770
I hate to tell you, though, 
but you're wrong. Poco's a boy.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:29.680
Seriously?

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.800
Seriously.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:31.990
Right, Poco?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.900
You're too overprotective.

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:38.310
D-Do you think so?

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.670
If I'd known he was a boy, 
I would've swung him around like crazy.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.040
Please don't!

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.940
All right! Let's get fishin'.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.000
Like a robot...

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:58.950
Poco, we use this as bait to catch the fi—

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.840
<i>He ate it?!</i>

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.080
Souta! Yummy!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.670
Huh? It is?!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:04.660
No, you can't!

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:05.820
You just can't!

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.090
It's for fish!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.890
That's right. You hold the rod like this...

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.030
Like this...

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.330
Right. Then you take this...

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.620
I've got a lot of thoughts about this,

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.000
but to sum it up...

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.250
It's just wrong...

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:26.470
What's with that?! 
Don't arbitrarily sum it up!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.990
<b>10 Minutes Later</b>

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.240
<b>20 Minutes Later</b>

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:37.970
He got bored.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:39.700
Well, nothing's biting.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.390
Oh, yeah.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.720
You remember Kimura from our
class in middle school, right?

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.400
Sure.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.460
I ran into him not too long ago,

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.610
and he said he's trying for a second kid. 
Looked all happy about it.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.470
Wow! A second, huh?

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.010
"Wow"?

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.970
You're basically a parent now, too, aren't you?

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:03.420
I guess, but it's like I skipped the marriage 
part and went straight to parenting...

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.650
What about you? 
Aren't you going to get married?

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:11.680
Don't nag me like my ma.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:12.300
Huh?

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:15.700
The other day, I dropped by my parents' house...

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.320
<b>Pathology</b>

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.320
<b>Pediatrics</b>

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.320
<b>Pediatric Orthopedics</b>

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.620
Shinobu?

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:22.120
You should have told me 
you were coming home!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.580
I only came by to grab a book.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.920
Goodness... At least stay for dinner.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.680
What are you eatin' before dinner?

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.260
Do you want some?

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.130
No!

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.970
It's oiri. Brings back memories, right?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.140
I got them as a wedding favor.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:41.780
You remember Machiko-neesan's 
daughter, don't you?

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.390
The one who's your age?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.370
She looked so beautiful.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:47.770
It must be nice to have a girl...

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.520
I hope you bring a bride home soon, too...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.150
<b>Shuffle Shuffle</b>

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.590
Hey! Wait, Shinobu!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.020
These days she's been bringin' up

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.070
arranged marriage interviews.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.950
Why not try it?

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.120
I ain't interested in marriage interviews!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:08.020
While we're on the subject, 
how's your dad doing? Good?

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.930
Our hospital director is still alive and kicking.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:11.880
That's good.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.750
But I hear that after his last checkup,

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.050
he can't smoke or drink anymore.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.760
You "hear"?

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.820
When we talk face-to-face, 
we always end up arguin'.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.920
Well, not as much as we used to, though.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:28.130
We've both gotten older, I guess...

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.960
Yeah, we're 30 already.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.770
Old enough to think about 
giving them grandkids.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.090
The other day, I was talking to a senpai.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:37.980
Yeah?

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:41.740
He said that a man's vector for happiness 
tends to fall on one of two sides.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:45.220
There are guys whose
family is their happiness,

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.880
and guys who put their career first...

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:52.340
I've always been the son of a doctor.

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:56.680
Now that I have this career,
I want to work hard,

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:59.370
learn more,

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.000
and help every last patient that I can.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:07.990
So to be honest, marriage is the
last thing on my mind right now.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.980
I guess before we can really 
talk about getting married,

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.710
we'd have to get girlfriends first, huh?

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:16.940
Did ya really have to say that?

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.060
In any case,

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:24.340
you're going to stay here in Kagawa, right?

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.700
Why ask that all of a sudden?

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:26.610
Well...

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:29.400
The thing is,

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.780
we might sell the house and the restaurant.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.540
My sister and I discussed it on the phone,

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:38.820
and we decided that we need to
at least get them cleaned up,

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.400
so I came back here...

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.960
But if we do end up selling it,

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:47.060
I don't think I'd be coming back 
to Kagawa that much anymore.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:51.050
When I saw how empty the 
house looks with Dad gone...

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:56.250
I thought... I don't really 
want this place to be gone.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.670
Losing a place to go home to...

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.660
It's kind of... lonely, I guess.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.920
Once I started thinking that,

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:06.910
I couldn't concentrate on work.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.920
Then you should move back here, shouldn't ya?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.190
That's easier said than done.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.450
I'd have to quit my job.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:20.300
So bite the bullet and take over 
the udon restaurant already.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.000
Huh?

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.530
Right... The udon restaurant...

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:27.390
The udon restaurant, huh...

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.890
What's this about a technical school in Tokyo?

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:33.410
I won't be an inconvenience to you.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.050
I'll get a job an' pay the tuition myself.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.900
That ain't what I'm sayin'!

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:40.660
Instead of goin' off to some strange school,

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:41.990
help with the restaurant!

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.760
No. I don't wanna

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:46.990
run some dumb udon restaurant.

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:50.880
No matter what you say, I'm goin' to Tokyo!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.080
Do what ya want.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:03.340
It's not so simple for me to take it over.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:08.590
Then hurry up and sell the house and 
the restaurant, and go back to Tokyo.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:12.000
But as things are now,

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.890
I can't go back until I sort 
through my feelings, I guess...

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.150
Can't ya work from here?

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.360
Well, I've managed to do this for ten years now.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.710
I think I have the skill to work as a freelancer.

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:29.070
But I'm not sure there's really 
any Web design work out here.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.840
Then you'd have to go back to Tokyo, right?

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.160
I guess, but...

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:35.710
I have Poco now, too...

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.670
Sheesh!

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:39.670
You're always pussyfootin' around. 
It drives me nuts!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:41.280
Souta!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:40.670
Huh?!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.170
We can't catch any fish because you're like that!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.420
Huh?! What gives?

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.990
It's not my fault they aren't biting!

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.540
Nakaji...

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.180
H... H... Here...

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.460
Huh? I don't want your crab!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:55.050
Don't take it out on Poco, too! 
You're such a child.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:56.560
Which of us is the child here?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.540
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.560
Souta... Nakaji...

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.940
If you've got something 
to say to me, then say it!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.880
Souta! Nakaji!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:05.690
Poco?!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.110
It's heavy! Is it a black porgy?!

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.120
Porgy, yummy?!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.620
Porgy are disgusting!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.850
Hey, Souta! What are you waitin' for?!

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.370
Get the net! The net!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.620
Where is it?! Where's the net?! Where?!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.210
Poco! You gotta hold on 'til the end!

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.420
'Til the end!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.840
That's it! Just like that!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.670
Here goes!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.830
I didn't know you could catch them here.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.650
It's my first time catchin' an octopus, too.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:53.200
Souta...

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.420
Octopus, octopus...

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.380
Octopus...

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:11.560
Nakajima.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:12.730
Yeah?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.850
We've fished here before, haven't we?

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.270
All right! We're gonna catch a lot today!

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:24.270
The home page you made for me...

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.710
It's gettin' tons of views!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.030
<b>Nickname: Nakaji 
Kagawa Prefecture 
My hobby is sea fishing. I also like eating.</b>

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:30.590
We're gonna catch some big ones
and get even more views!

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:32.530
That's fine with me, but...

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.680
Why are we in our school uniforms?

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.970
So we can go straight to school after.

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:38.970
Because we'll be fishin' 'til morning!

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:42.540
'Til morning?! How much do you wanna catch?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.210
I got a bite!

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:46.730
Souta! Get the net! The net!

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:49.050
Huh?! The net? The net?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.060
What're you doin'? Hurry!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:51.970
Where's the net?!

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:55.550
Whoa...

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.040
This's a good one!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.440
Souta, upload the rubbing I make 
of it to my home page, would ya?

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.690
You got it!

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.970
Listen, Nakajima.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:06.670
What?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:09.830
I'm thinkin' about goin' to Tokyo.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.180
I want to study Web design up there.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.710
Honestly, I haven't gone fishing 
or anything since then.

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.320
You know, I... How do I put this?

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:29.400
It's like for the longest time, 
I forgot there was a life like this.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:33.150
And now, coming back to Kagawa, 
spending time with Poco...

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.740
Realizing all these things, thanks to Poco...

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.420
I know this is late in coming, but...

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:47.590
I think I actually like it here a lot.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:53.570
You really have changed.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.690
Huh?

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:56.570
Hmph! Nothin'.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.690
Hey, Poco!

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:03.160
Amuse me more!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.850
Wait up!

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:08.540
Hey, hey, hey! Look at the octopus!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.480
Hey, hey, hey!

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:19.150
A lighthouse is a guide for boats out at sea

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.560
to follow when they want to go home.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.220
Souta!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.510
Get over here!

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:27.860
Over here!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.280
Hey now, Poco. Don't copy me!

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:41.250
He's so...

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.940
Nakajima! Carry something!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:58.550
<b>Kagawa</b>

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:58.550
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:56.250
Huh? Shinobu-chan's car?

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:58.070
What's he doin' here so early?

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.760
Good grief.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.020
What are you grown men doin'?

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:46.950
<b>Gaogao-chan and</b>

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.950
<b>The Blue Sky</b>

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.150
<i>The Tale of Gaogao-chan and</i>

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:52.960
<b>Episode 3:</b>

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:52.960
<b>"Gaogao-chan and Earth in Danger"</b>

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:52.040
<i>Earth in Danger!</i>

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:56.170
<i>Mimi and Momo took Gaogao-chan</i>

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:59.030
<i>to a beautiful spot from which 
they could see the sea.</i>

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.970
<i>If they could talk together 
while looking at the sea,</i>

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.080
<i>surely Gaogao-chan would reconsider 
his plans to conquer Earth.</i>

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:08.550
<i>Gao?</i>

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.410
<i>That's the Red Lighthouse Cannon.</i>

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:14.980
<i>He's protected the sea for years and years!</i>

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.870
<i>Mimi and I used to talk about</i>

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:20.990
<i>all kinds of bittersweet things here.</i>

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.950
<i>We were so young!</i>

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:23.990
<i>Uh-huh!</i>

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.390
<i>Young... Gao...</i>

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:34.000
<i>Gaogao, what are you going to do 
when you grow up, Gyao?</i>

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:37.380
<i>I will conquer that blue planet, Gao!</i>

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.100
<i>Cool!</i>

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:41.960
<i>Once you've conquered it, 
can I come over to play, Gyao?</i>

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:44.230
<i>Gao. Come join me, Gao.</i>

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.890
<i>Help!</i>

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:48.890
<i>Gao?!</i>

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.520
<i>That hurts!</i>

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:52.520
<i>I-I'll break!</i>

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:54.860
<i>Is that an alien octopus, Gao?!</i>

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:58.450
<i>I'm taking these women, Octopus!</i>

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:00.650
<i>Release those girls at once!</i>

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:05.000
<i>I will not allow anyone 
to disturb the sea's peace!</i>

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.370
<i>Red Lighthouse Cannon, fire! Boom!</i>

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:12.290
<i>Impossible! The Red Lighthouse 
Cannon is powerful enough</i>

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.750
<i>to burn up Earth twice over with 
only one shot, and he deflected it?!</i>

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.080
<i>Octopus!</i>

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.690
<i>Nooo! Anywhere but the face!</i>

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.640
<i>It's all over now!</i>

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.680
<i>He'll use these slimy things to...</i>

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.510
<i>Take this!</i>

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.640
<i>Gaogao-chan?!</i>

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:33.390
<i>Get your filthy hands... 
er, tentacles... off of them, Gao!</i>

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:37.820
<i>Which tentacles might you mean?</i>

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:42.030
<i>Too bad for you, Octopus!</i>

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.170
<i>Gaogao-chan!</i>

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:45.530
<i>Stop!</i>

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:50.260
<i>The eyes!</i>

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.580
<i>Aim for the eyes!</i>

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.220
<i>How underhanded...</i>

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:54.640
<i>Very well!</i>

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:58.630
<i>Special attack... Gaogao Lancer!</i>

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:02.310
<i>Argh! He got me, Octopus!</i>

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:10.690
<i>Gaogao-chan, thanks for saving us!</i>

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:13.680
<i>I was merely acting in self-defense.</i>

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:16.360
<i>Hey, Gaogao-chan, you came here</i>

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:18.640
<i>to conquer Earth... right?</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:24.230
<i>This planet... is beautiful...</i>

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:32.220
<i>Gaogao-chan had begun to</i>

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:34.030
<i>take a liking to Earth.</i>

