<b>Udon Prefecture 
Vice Governor</b>

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:50.930
<b>Narration: Kaname Jun</b>

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:43.900
In high school, I went to the 
track and field stadium here

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:46.470
for track competitions quite often.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:48.330
Naturally, I rode the Kotoden.

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:49.680
Next time: "Yashima."
